WEBVTT

01:44.580 --> 01:45.580
How about this one?

01:56.340 --> 01:57.840
Look at me.

02:00.380 --> 02:02.600
FOX PROFESSIONAL OPTICAL

02:02.640 --> 02:03.640
This one.

02:08.160 --> 02:09.100
Hello.

02:09.820 --> 02:12.700
- Hello.
- How much is this?

02:12.740 --> 02:14.800
- 2,800.
- 2,800.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.780
How about this one?

02:16.700 --> 02:18.700
- 3,200.
- 3,200.

02:18.740 --> 02:19.580
Right.

02:20.560 --> 02:21.460
Which one is better?

02:27.060 --> 02:28.060
Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:30.620 --> 02:31.680
What's the matter?

02:32.680 --> 02:33.760
Why don't you speak?

02:35.160 --> 02:36.740
Didn't you tell me

02:36.780 --> 02:38.940
to share my feelings now?

02:39.440 --> 02:40.700
That I could lean on you more?

02:44.960 --> 02:45.800
Okay.

02:47.240 --> 02:48.740
So, what do you want?

02:49.240 --> 02:51.580
Pick one. My treat.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.140
How about this one?

02:53.180 --> 02:54.420
No sunglasses.

02:54.460 --> 02:55.480
I want something else.

02:55.980 --> 02:56.820
Something else?

02:58.400 --> 03:00.660
Fine. We've still got six or 7,000 left

03:00.700 --> 03:02.400
after the sunglasses.

03:02.900 --> 03:03.900
Go wild.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.640
Let me buy Yu Qiao's sunglasses.

03:13.680 --> 03:16.200
I actually want to get him a gift.

03:17.860 --> 03:18.880
Why?

03:19.740 --> 03:22.660
Last time Yu Qiao was in Hong Kong,
he said something to me.

03:24.100 --> 03:25.280
When I think about it,

03:25.780 --> 03:28.500
he did spend more time
with you than I did.

03:29.100 --> 03:30.120
Maybe…

03:30.620 --> 03:32.200
he really does know you better.

03:33.520 --> 03:36.000
You… Why would you say
something like that?

03:39.980 --> 03:41.200
I just wanted to say

03:41.840 --> 03:42.780
thank you, Yingtao.

03:43.780 --> 03:45.300
For never giving up on me.

03:52.080 --> 03:53.540
Don't talk like that anymore.

03:57.980 --> 03:59.620
The truth is,

03:59.660 --> 04:01.940
Yu Qiao also considers you as a friend.

04:02.440 --> 04:03.540
He does care about you.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.360
You know what?

04:05.860 --> 04:08.700
He was the one who gave me
your address in Hong Kong.

04:09.200 --> 04:10.240
Without him,

04:10.740 --> 04:12.080
finding you

04:12.580 --> 04:14.500
would've been so much harder.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.200
So,

04:17.200 --> 04:18.600
I should thank him too.

04:20.620 --> 04:22.280
You two are the same kind of people.

04:23.380 --> 04:26.660
Both of you just want others to be happy.

04:28.760 --> 04:29.900
Look in the mirror.

04:33.100 --> 04:34.000
It suits you well.

04:40.120 --> 04:42.000
Do you want me back
in Hongyang for school?

04:48.960 --> 04:50.180
What do you mean?

04:53.920 --> 04:55.420
Never mind. Just talking nonsense.

04:56.840 --> 04:57.820
Wanna buy something?

04:57.860 --> 04:59.940
We hit the jackpot.
Gotta splurge a little, right?

05:03.880 --> 05:05.260
I've got it all planned out.

05:06.120 --> 05:08.980
I'll get cousin some plants.

05:09.020 --> 05:11.380
He has been out of the hospital.

05:11.420 --> 05:12.680
Greenery helps with recovery.

05:12.720 --> 05:15.200
And sis-in-law deserves fine wine.

05:15.700 --> 05:18.040
We have to celebrate his discharge.

05:18.080 --> 05:19.360
Oh, and…

05:19.400 --> 05:20.500
Rui, right?

05:20.540 --> 05:23.260
We can buy her toys or new clothes.

05:23.300 --> 05:25.000
Plus Uncle and Aunt,

05:25.040 --> 05:25.960
- they should--
- Wait.

05:26.000 --> 05:28.020
Not getting anything for yourself?

05:28.580 --> 05:30.240
- Cousin and sis-in-law told me
- I don't…

05:30.280 --> 05:32.020
to take you shopping properly.

05:33.380 --> 05:34.240
So, what'll it be?

05:34.280 --> 05:35.640
Lipstick? High heels?

05:35.680 --> 05:36.640
Fine by me.

05:38.080 --> 05:40.080
I'm pretty enough without lipstick,

05:40.120 --> 05:42.260
and tall enough without heels.

05:42.880 --> 05:43.720
I'll stand there.

05:46.240 --> 05:47.360
Let me tell you this.

05:47.400 --> 05:48.700
Those things

05:48.740 --> 05:50.100
mean nothing to me.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.680
They are meaningful

05:52.220 --> 05:53.140
because you gave them to me.

05:56.760 --> 05:58.220
Yingtao,

05:58.260 --> 05:59.420
you are too good.

05:59.460 --> 06:01.380
It feels impossible to let you leave.

06:04.880 --> 06:07.400
Even if you can't bear it,
there's no choice.

06:07.960 --> 06:09.640
I'm leaving the day after tomorrow.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.980
I know.

06:15.820 --> 06:17.140
So,

06:17.180 --> 06:19.560
let's make the most of our time
and go shopping.

06:19.600 --> 06:20.880
No more sad faces.

06:21.860 --> 06:24.160
Then, tonight,
we'll visit cousin and sis-in-law.

06:24.660 --> 06:25.740
Alright.

06:25.780 --> 06:27.400
I have things to discuss with them anyway.

07:00.340 --> 07:01.920
TO BE SAFE AND SUCCESSFUL

07:07.000 --> 07:07.840
Sis-in-law.

07:08.640 --> 07:09.860
Sis-in-law. We're here!

07:09.900 --> 07:11.300
Just a moment.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.360
- Coming.
- Sis-in-law.

07:13.400 --> 07:14.880
Sis-in-law, today, your beauty

07:15.380 --> 07:18.740
"puts the moon to shame, makes flowers
blush, and outshines all nature's charms".

07:18.780 --> 07:20.500
No one cheers me up like Yingtao does.

07:20.540 --> 07:21.540
Thank you.

07:22.040 --> 07:23.440
Let me in.

07:23.940 --> 07:25.560
Money Tree.

07:25.600 --> 07:28.420
- Money Tree? Thanks.
- Auntie, Uncle.

07:28.460 --> 07:30.760
Uncle, these supplements are for you.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.640
- Thank you.
- Cousin.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.800
I'm not sitting up.

07:33.460 --> 07:35.060
- Cheers.
- Soup for wine, then.

07:35.100 --> 07:36.560
- Cheers.
- Yingtao, thanks for the wine.

07:36.600 --> 07:37.840
Thank you.

07:40.500 --> 07:42.320
You actually won the Mark Six

07:42.360 --> 07:43.540
and got over nine grand?

07:43.580 --> 07:44.920
Yes.

07:44.960 --> 07:46.680
Never actually thought we'd win!

07:46.720 --> 07:48.600
Yingtao, you're absolutely right.

07:48.640 --> 07:50.080
To live is to hope.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.920
Let me say this.

07:52.420 --> 07:53.340
Cousin,

07:53.380 --> 07:55.580
these two years, you've carried so much.

07:56.460 --> 07:57.500
Thanks.

07:57.540 --> 08:00.280
And to everyone who cared for me,

08:00.880 --> 08:03.640
it wasn't easy. Especially my wife.

08:04.140 --> 08:05.480
Don't say these things.

08:06.240 --> 08:07.080
I must say it.

08:07.580 --> 08:10.600
I still have old unpaid debts.

08:10.640 --> 08:14.360
Sure, collecting now's harder,

08:14.860 --> 08:17.680
but if I show up in person,

08:17.720 --> 08:20.300
they'll cough up something.
My reputation still counts.

08:20.340 --> 08:21.280
No big deal.

08:22.400 --> 08:25.640
So, consider
our family's troubles settled.

08:26.480 --> 08:27.500
So,

08:27.540 --> 08:29.180
Qiaoxi, your part-time jobs

08:29.680 --> 08:30.640
might as well stop here.

08:30.680 --> 08:35.039
You've had a gift for math
since you were a child.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.000
Don't waste it.

08:36.039 --> 08:37.520
Focus on school now.

08:38.520 --> 08:40.080
Use this time

08:40.120 --> 08:41.480
to really think

08:41.520 --> 08:43.200
about where

08:43.240 --> 08:44.520
you want to go.

08:45.980 --> 08:46.860
Cousin.

08:47.420 --> 08:48.680
I've actually

08:49.180 --> 08:50.160
made up my mind.

08:50.820 --> 08:51.660
Good.

08:52.740 --> 08:54.040
I want to…

08:56.600 --> 08:57.700
go back to Hongyang.

08:58.200 --> 08:59.700
You don't want to study at HKU anymore?

09:01.140 --> 09:03.040
It's only been a year.

09:03.540 --> 09:05.400
The knowledge hasn't leaked out yet.

09:05.440 --> 09:07.280
If I return,

09:07.320 --> 09:09.020
I could still ace the exams.

09:09.780 --> 09:11.860
But you're studying finance now.

09:11.900 --> 09:13.700
In this career,

09:13.740 --> 09:15.860
an education background from Hong Kong

09:15.900 --> 09:18.180
will give you an edge, right?

09:19.660 --> 09:22.980
Ruocheng, I get Qiaoxi's feelings.

09:23.900 --> 09:24.940
But I think,

09:25.460 --> 09:27.840
if he stays here for school,

09:27.880 --> 09:30.500
the long distance between him
and Yingtao will go on for three years.

09:32.920 --> 09:33.980
Alright.

09:34.020 --> 09:35.900
For Ruocheng to be home for dinner today,

09:35.940 --> 09:37.260
I talked the doctor's ear off

09:37.300 --> 09:38.240
to make it happen.

09:38.280 --> 09:39.520
He'll need to go back soon.

09:40.060 --> 09:42.160
For a matter so important
as Qiaoxi's education,

09:42.200 --> 09:44.020
let's not talk about it at the table.

09:44.520 --> 09:45.360
Let's eat.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.780
- Sure.
- Have dinner first.

09:46.820 --> 09:48.340
- Eat first.
- Cousin, listen.

09:48.380 --> 09:49.340
Eat.

09:49.380 --> 09:50.300
No.

09:50.340 --> 09:51.420
Let me say this first.

09:51.460 --> 09:52.380
Actually,

09:52.420 --> 09:53.480
I know

09:53.520 --> 09:55.800
emotions matter.

09:56.380 --> 09:58.960
But what matters more

09:59.000 --> 10:01.060
is the will to act on them.

10:01.100 --> 10:03.760
Don't just see the present.

10:03.800 --> 10:07.020
Look at your future. Right?

10:07.520 --> 10:09.480
Now my words mean nothing, right?

10:10.020 --> 10:10.920
Enough.

10:11.420 --> 10:13.280
No heavy talk at dinner.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.380
- Okay.
- Eat.

10:14.420 --> 10:15.460
- Let's eat.
- Sure.

10:15.500 --> 10:16.580
- Come.
- Eat, Yingtao.

10:16.620 --> 10:17.880
- Have some.
- Eat.

10:17.920 --> 10:20.000
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

10:20.040 --> 10:20.880
Cheer up!

10:20.920 --> 10:21.760
Cheer up!

10:21.800 --> 10:23.920
- We say "cheer up" in Cantonese.
- Cheer up.

10:23.960 --> 10:24.800
Cheer up.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.540
- We say "help yourself".
- Help yourself.

10:26.580 --> 10:27.540
- Help yourself.
- Help yourself.

10:27.580 --> 10:29.340
I… I understand a little.

10:29.380 --> 10:32.620
When I was little, I loved watching
The Condor Heroes with Mom and Dad.

10:32.660 --> 10:33.820
And I really,

10:34.320 --> 10:36.080
really loved Xiaolongnü.

10:36.120 --> 10:38.520
Are you implying I look like her?

10:38.560 --> 10:40.160
I've heard that a lot.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.660
- Really?
- So many people say that.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.540
- It's true.
- No wonder

10:42.580 --> 10:43.900
I felt this instant connection

10:43.940 --> 10:45.500
- with sis-in-law.
- How lucky I am,

10:45.540 --> 10:46.700
married to an actual celestial.

10:49.740 --> 10:51.280
You…

10:51.820 --> 10:53.560
really plan to…

10:54.060 --> 10:55.640
retake the college entrance exam?

10:58.100 --> 10:59.740
I've already made you wait two years.

11:00.280 --> 11:02.000
I can't just sit idle

11:02.520 --> 11:04.220
and ask for three more.

11:07.600 --> 11:10.260
But you're already an HKU student.

11:10.300 --> 11:12.040
Why go back to retake the exam?

11:12.540 --> 11:14.780
The pressure would crush you.

11:16.940 --> 11:19.020
Yingtao, remember

11:19.680 --> 11:21.320
what I told you in Hongyang

11:21.360 --> 11:23.720
after the exam?

11:27.220 --> 11:28.060
I said,

11:28.560 --> 11:30.620
"I want to go to school with you,

11:31.540 --> 11:33.080
to the library with you,

11:33.580 --> 11:34.600
to the cafeteria with you."

11:35.100 --> 11:37.520
Even if you attend university in Hongyang,

11:38.020 --> 11:40.680
we'd only have one year
of those days. Right?

11:40.720 --> 11:41.560
It's okay.

11:42.060 --> 11:45.000
If there's a chance,
even just one year, I'll take it.

11:46.460 --> 11:50.480
DISCOUNT SAVES YOU MORE

11:56.740 --> 11:59.760
You asked me to make it up to you
for your 18th birthday.

12:00.260 --> 12:01.500
And here we are for a wok?

12:02.880 --> 12:03.720
Yes.

12:04.720 --> 12:06.800
I've always loved cooking.

12:06.840 --> 12:09.180
Just too swamped these past two years

12:09.220 --> 12:10.600
to even cook for myself.

12:11.100 --> 12:12.940
But now, with cousin doing better,

12:13.440 --> 12:15.080
I thought I'd dust off this old skill.

12:16.440 --> 12:18.100
Seriously, don't save money for me.

12:18.640 --> 12:21.040
I've stacked enough from tutoring

12:21.080 --> 12:22.420
and our lottery bonus.

12:22.920 --> 12:24.260
You can ask for something more.

12:26.380 --> 12:27.260
How about this?

12:27.760 --> 12:28.980
You once said

12:29.020 --> 12:30.380
sis-in-law thinks

12:30.420 --> 12:33.080
lipstick and heels make a girl grown up.

12:33.120 --> 12:34.260
Go ask cousin

12:34.300 --> 12:36.640
what he thinks makes a boy grown up.

12:37.140 --> 12:38.900
I could get you

12:38.940 --> 12:40.920
a suit, leather shoes.

12:40.960 --> 12:42.240
You'd look damn sharp.

12:42.280 --> 12:45.320
No suits, no leather shoes.

12:45.360 --> 12:46.860
To me,

12:46.900 --> 12:49.100
a man's real coming-of-age gift

12:50.560 --> 12:51.880
is a full set of kitchenware.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.900
Seriously?

12:53.940 --> 12:55.200
Seriously.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.580
Besides,

12:59.140 --> 13:00.600
you leave tomorrow.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.920
I want to cook for you.

13:10.080 --> 13:10.920
Alright.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.660
But what if this grand production

13:13.700 --> 13:15.640
ends in disaster?

13:16.140 --> 13:17.720
Two years out of practice, Chef.

13:18.260 --> 13:19.400
Underestimating me?

13:19.920 --> 13:21.300
Lots of cookbooks are stored here.

13:22.100 --> 13:24.080
Why did you store them if you didn't cook?

13:24.980 --> 13:26.120
You don't get it.

13:26.160 --> 13:28.220
These recipes are fuel for daydreams.

13:29.160 --> 13:30.040
Fuel for daydreams?

13:32.180 --> 13:34.320
So, when you're starving,

13:34.880 --> 13:36.300
you just lick the pages?

13:37.360 --> 13:38.320
No.

13:40.400 --> 13:42.080
Didn't you say

13:42.720 --> 13:44.100
when we're apart,

13:44.600 --> 13:46.600
you'd imagine me from other universes?

13:48.580 --> 13:49.880
Me too.

13:51.620 --> 13:53.340
When we were apart,

13:53.840 --> 13:55.020
I imagined us

13:55.520 --> 13:57.200
in another universe.

13:59.640 --> 14:01.160
In that universe,

14:01.200 --> 14:02.940
we stay together.

14:04.380 --> 14:07.100
And I cook for you.

14:12.560 --> 14:13.520
Then…

14:15.620 --> 14:16.600
you'd better step up.

14:16.640 --> 14:19.520
I grew up on your Auntie Juan's cooking.

14:19.560 --> 14:22.120
If yours sucks, I will starve.

14:24.480 --> 14:27.260
Beating Auntie Juan? Impossible.

14:28.340 --> 14:29.440
But I'll keep practicing.

14:30.120 --> 14:31.920
As long as you want
to come home for meals.

14:58.260 --> 15:00.240
Did you remember what I just said?

15:00.920 --> 15:01.900
Pick oranges

15:01.940 --> 15:04.720
with round, pretty navels.

15:04.760 --> 15:05.660
Those are the sweet ones.

15:06.160 --> 15:07.260
- Understood?
- Yes!

15:09.600 --> 15:11.060
Hang on. I'll check it.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.560
Yingtao.

15:16.900 --> 15:20.320
Don't you feel…
we've lived this exact life

15:20.980 --> 15:22.380
since forever ago?

15:22.880 --> 15:24.940
Obviously!

15:25.460 --> 15:27.500
We did grow up together.

15:28.480 --> 15:30.500
Mooching meals at my place. You are just

15:30.540 --> 15:31.500
impossible to get rid of.

15:32.940 --> 15:35.140
But wandering around in the aisle
together, like now,

15:35.180 --> 15:37.280
thinking about dinner,
it is the first time.

15:38.460 --> 15:40.320
I feels like

15:40.360 --> 15:43.860
we've lived this exact day
a hundred times before.

15:45.600 --> 15:46.540
Jiang Qiaoxi.

15:46.580 --> 15:48.820
How did I only just realize

15:49.320 --> 15:50.820
you're quiet as a shadow,

15:51.420 --> 15:54.440
yet your mind's
a constellation of wild ideas?

15:55.160 --> 15:57.180
Now, it's even better than I imagined.

15:58.880 --> 16:00.900
I want to turn all these daydreams

16:00.940 --> 16:02.100
into our reality.

16:03.380 --> 16:04.240
Buy this one.

16:04.860 --> 16:05.700
Okay.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.920
Yingtao.

16:15.100 --> 16:16.440
I…

16:16.480 --> 16:17.760
I won't keep you waiting long.

16:17.800 --> 16:20.080
Even if I continue my studies at HKU,

16:20.120 --> 16:23.140
I'll return to Hongyang soon to see you.

16:26.920 --> 16:27.820
Promise me

16:27.860 --> 16:30.640
you'll come quickly. Run to me.

16:38.440 --> 16:39.660
CHEWING GUM, CONDOM

16:58.820 --> 17:01.040
Do you want it?

17:04.240 --> 17:05.460
Just buy it if you want.

17:11.680 --> 17:12.900
You think

17:13.400 --> 17:14.540
I don't know?

17:17.880 --> 17:19.040
It's okay.

17:20.220 --> 17:22.400
I understand.

17:28.060 --> 17:29.160
Well,

17:29.200 --> 17:30.840
are… are you serious?

17:32.960 --> 17:35.180
I saw it all.

17:37.680 --> 17:39.160
There are cigarettes on your windowsill.

17:39.900 --> 17:41.000
You're smoking, right?

17:42.860 --> 17:45.500
It's okay. My dad used to smoke too,

17:45.540 --> 17:47.240
but he quit for my mom later.

17:47.280 --> 17:48.880
He also quit by eating chewing gum.

17:55.740 --> 17:57.020
I don't smoke much normally,

17:57.060 --> 17:58.280
so I can quit easily.

17:58.320 --> 18:00.080
This one looks good.

18:01.000 --> 18:01.980
Or…

18:02.020 --> 18:02.680
CONDOM

18:28.180 --> 18:29.620
Excuse me.

18:29.660 --> 18:30.900
Are you ready to pay?

18:30.940 --> 18:31.780
Coming.

20:27.300 --> 20:30.340
You two are seriously pure love right now.

20:34.740 --> 20:36.220
Want to join us for a meal later?

20:37.460 --> 20:38.580
Sure.

20:45.180 --> 20:46.180
- After you.
- Brother Yin.

20:46.960 --> 20:48.320
You brat,

20:48.880 --> 20:50.840
I've been kind to you for two years.

20:50.880 --> 20:52.600
You don't even cook one meal for me?

20:53.620 --> 20:54.460
Brother Yin.

20:55.460 --> 20:57.200
Tell me

20:57.240 --> 20:59.280
how he got through these two years.

21:00.040 --> 21:01.380
- You really want to hear?
- Yes.

21:01.900 --> 21:02.900
I'm afraid you'll cry.

21:02.940 --> 21:04.080
He had it really rough. No.

21:04.120 --> 21:06.000
No way you can make me cry.

21:06.040 --> 21:07.940
Hard to get me cry. Go ahead. Try me.

21:10.200 --> 21:11.360
Hang on!

21:11.400 --> 21:12.820
Don't be fooled by her.

21:12.860 --> 21:14.300
She cries easily.

21:15.960 --> 21:17.000
Do I share or not?

21:17.040 --> 21:18.020
Go ahead.

21:18.060 --> 21:20.520
Let me tell you how dumb he was
when he first arrived.

21:20.560 --> 21:23.040
He thought everything here
was super hardcore.

21:23.080 --> 21:24.800
He acted like some tough guy,
even faked a limp.

21:26.060 --> 21:27.880
And that scar on his head?

21:27.920 --> 21:29.940
You'd need a magnifier to see it.

21:29.980 --> 21:32.100
But he'd flip his hair all day

21:32.140 --> 21:34.260
just to show it off,
thinking it made him look scary.

21:34.300 --> 21:35.520
Why do you blurt out everything?

21:35.560 --> 21:37.820
He looks really funny like that.

21:38.320 --> 21:39.540
Back then,

21:39.580 --> 21:40.560
I hated you.

21:40.600 --> 21:43.100
Barely scraping together rent,

21:43.140 --> 21:44.540
yet acting all high and mighty.

21:44.580 --> 21:46.160
If it wasn't that my dad liked you,

21:46.200 --> 21:48.760
I'd have kicked you out instantly.

21:49.840 --> 21:51.620
See how kind Brother Yin is?

21:51.660 --> 21:53.900
Back when you were all airs and arrogance,

21:53.940 --> 21:55.980
he still took you in
and treated you this well.

21:56.020 --> 21:57.160
I never acted arrogantly!

21:57.200 --> 21:58.600
Don't listen to his nonsense.

21:58.640 --> 22:00.420
Yingtao, I'm the landlord here.

22:00.920 --> 22:03.340
A landlord's supposed to kick people out

22:03.380 --> 22:04.680
when they can't pay, right?

22:05.360 --> 22:06.260
But I helped him

22:06.760 --> 22:07.780
not because of that.

22:11.240 --> 22:12.680
Then what's the reason?

22:16.300 --> 22:17.580
Don't they always say

22:17.620 --> 22:20.080
men get soft over tears from ladies?

22:21.780 --> 22:23.820
In fact, men get soft over tears
from another man.

22:25.080 --> 22:26.100
That night,

22:26.600 --> 22:27.900
he was watching Titanic,

22:28.400 --> 22:29.240
and he wept.

22:29.940 --> 22:32.120
Titanic is indeed a real tearjerker.

22:32.160 --> 22:33.760
But don't most people cry

22:33.800 --> 22:36.480
when Rose see Jack sinking?

22:37.260 --> 22:38.320
Not him.

22:38.360 --> 22:39.200
He cried

22:39.240 --> 22:43.660
when Rose and Jack promised each other
to live a beautiful life together.

22:44.840 --> 22:47.380
That part was the most hopeful moment,

22:48.160 --> 22:50.260
yet he sobbed
so desperately, so miserably.

22:50.800 --> 22:53.340
That's when I realized this kid,

22:54.580 --> 22:56.100
he's actually kind of pitiful.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.840
Since Brother Yin just idles around,
I might as well

23:00.360 --> 23:01.560
look after him a little more.

23:07.340 --> 23:08.180
Brother Yin.

23:09.160 --> 23:10.500
Let me toast to you.

23:11.460 --> 23:14.140
Thank you for taking such good care
of Jiang Qiaoxi these past two years.

23:15.580 --> 23:16.420
You're welcome.

23:21.260 --> 23:22.820
Don't spit it out!

23:23.580 --> 23:26.540
Brother Yin's been saving
this premium liquor. It is not cheap.

23:27.040 --> 23:28.360
So? How does it taste?

23:28.860 --> 23:29.700
This…

23:30.660 --> 23:31.780
It is so strong!

23:32.480 --> 23:33.860
- Stop drinking.
- It burns.

23:33.900 --> 23:35.620
- It burns like hell.
- It burns?

23:36.160 --> 23:37.000
Bottoms up!

23:37.900 --> 23:39.520
I'll add some ice.

23:43.260 --> 23:44.100
Brother Yin.

23:44.600 --> 23:46.240
I've had quite a few fine drinks

23:46.740 --> 23:48.200
here in Hong Kong.

23:49.140 --> 23:51.660
Red wine
with Jiang Qiaoxi's cousin-in-law,

23:51.700 --> 23:53.680
and now your whiskey.

23:53.720 --> 23:55.940
They're all premium stuff,
really expensive.

23:55.980 --> 23:56.860
But

23:56.900 --> 24:00.960
no matter how I try,
I just can't acquire the taste.

24:01.460 --> 24:03.740
Why do you all enjoy drinking so much?

24:03.780 --> 24:06.460
Nobody's born liking alcohol.

24:06.960 --> 24:08.040
I drink

24:08.640 --> 24:09.800
when I have no other choice.

24:10.380 --> 24:12.400
Not everyone's like Vincent,

24:12.440 --> 24:14.400
lucky enough to have a girl like you
who dotes on him.

24:15.040 --> 24:16.360
I have nobody to care for me,

24:17.740 --> 24:18.920
so I drink.

24:19.600 --> 24:21.120
Who'd believe that?

24:21.160 --> 24:23.020
Jiang Qiaoxi said you're a real player.

24:26.780 --> 24:29.380
That was just acting
for the occasion. It doesn't count.

24:31.580 --> 24:33.260
I wasn't good to them,

24:33.300 --> 24:34.960
and they weren't good to me either.

24:35.000 --> 24:36.220
Fair and square.

24:40.100 --> 24:41.100
Eat.

24:46.960 --> 24:48.440
Don't be sad.

24:48.480 --> 24:50.320
You'll definitely meet

24:50.360 --> 24:52.280
- Don't feel bad for him.
- someone someday.

24:52.780 --> 24:54.500
You actually believe what he says?

24:55.020 --> 24:56.360
He owns this whole building

24:56.860 --> 24:59.120
and land in Lok Ma Chau.

24:59.160 --> 25:01.480
Dude stays up all night
counting land titles.

25:03.000 --> 25:03.920
You don't understand.

25:07.260 --> 25:08.520
Rainbows fade fast.

25:09.580 --> 25:10.680
Skyscrapers crumble easily.

25:11.340 --> 25:13.520
The things you can see with your eyes

25:13.560 --> 25:14.840
are actually the least valuable.

25:15.340 --> 25:17.040
Here today, gone tomorrow.

25:18.040 --> 25:20.040
It hasn't been easy for you two
all the way along.

25:21.680 --> 25:22.740
Hold on to each other tight.

25:24.080 --> 25:25.960
You're the truly lucky ones.

25:49.780 --> 25:51.000
Jiang Qiaoxi.

25:52.580 --> 25:53.420
Ying…

25:54.200 --> 25:55.040
tao.

26:01.420 --> 26:02.380
Jiang Qiaoxi.

26:09.820 --> 26:11.100
What's the matter, Yingtao?

26:13.700 --> 26:14.720
Are you a broken recorder?

26:18.060 --> 26:19.660
I just keep thinking…

26:21.860 --> 26:24.860
Tomorrow I won't hear you
answer me like this anymore.

26:26.980 --> 26:29.160
So, I want to say your name
a few extra times.

26:31.080 --> 26:31.980
Yingtao.

26:34.240 --> 26:35.220
You know…

26:38.660 --> 26:40.900
what I think every time…

26:43.500 --> 26:44.620
I hear you say my name?

26:51.520 --> 26:53.180
I was thinking…

26:55.860 --> 26:58.280
how can Lin Yingtao's voice
be this mesmerizing?

27:02.820 --> 27:04.320
No taste.

27:04.860 --> 27:05.780
Yingtao.

27:08.880 --> 27:10.100
All these years…

27:12.700 --> 27:16.160
I've been trying so hard
to prove that I am Jiang Qiaoxi.

27:18.140 --> 27:18.980
Back then,

27:19.520 --> 27:20.880
I had good grades.

27:21.380 --> 27:22.360
By silence,

27:22.860 --> 27:24.360
I gave up math

27:24.400 --> 27:26.220
and forfeited my guaranteed admission.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.500
Even

27:33.840 --> 27:35.580
resorted to extreme methods

27:37.220 --> 27:39.140
to prove I'm Jiang Qiaoxi.

27:40.820 --> 27:42.580
But just now,

27:43.080 --> 27:45.660
when I heard you say my name…

27:50.260 --> 27:51.860
I realized I've existed all along.

29:53.440 --> 29:54.280
Hello.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.520
Qin Yeyun.

30:02.380 --> 30:03.580
I'm…

30:03.620 --> 30:04.600
I'm…

30:06.400 --> 30:07.560
in Hong Kong.

30:08.180 --> 30:09.140
I know.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.480
I…

30:12.400 --> 30:13.820
found Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:16.220 --> 30:17.420
I know that too.

30:19.100 --> 30:20.220
Lin Yingtao.

30:20.260 --> 30:21.600
It's 3 a.m. in the morning.

30:26.700 --> 30:27.640
I…

30:30.400 --> 30:31.440
I know.

30:32.180 --> 30:33.520
How do you feel now?

30:33.560 --> 30:34.620
Happy or unhappy?

30:40.460 --> 30:42.160
I don't even know

30:43.440 --> 30:46.380
if I'm happy or not right now.

30:48.640 --> 30:50.160
It's just…

30:53.280 --> 30:55.480
I feel different from before.

30:57.120 --> 30:59.400
Yet somehow everything's still the same.

30:59.440 --> 31:01.360
Then wasn't this
whole phone call pointless?

31:01.400 --> 31:02.840
No.

31:10.560 --> 31:11.740
It's just…

31:12.420 --> 31:14.660
I think I suddenly discovered a secret.

31:16.380 --> 31:17.500
You know how

31:18.500 --> 31:20.020
when I used

31:21.240 --> 31:23.580
to see adults on the street,

31:24.880 --> 31:27.400
I always felt they shared
some common secrets?

31:29.880 --> 31:31.080
Well, now…

31:34.860 --> 31:36.720
I know it too.

31:39.540 --> 31:41.200
Damn it, Lin Yingtao.

31:41.760 --> 31:43.500
How did you figure it out before me?

31:48.060 --> 31:50.480
I shared it with you right away.

31:51.680 --> 31:53.920
You should be grinning inside.

31:56.140 --> 31:57.320
What do I do, Lin Yingtao?

31:57.820 --> 31:59.000
Now that you say it like that,

31:59.040 --> 32:00.540
I'm actually kind of scared.

32:00.580 --> 32:02.360
You're scared of something?

32:03.140 --> 32:05.800
I'm a girl too.
You think I don't get scared?

32:10.000 --> 32:10.980
Don't be scared.

32:12.600 --> 32:13.620
Just…

32:15.800 --> 32:17.820
be with someone you truly love.

32:19.740 --> 32:21.800
You won't feel scared
if you are with the one.

32:24.540 --> 32:26.120
That's all it takes.

32:54.280 --> 32:56.140
BEEF BRISKET NOODLES

33:29.900 --> 33:30.740
Yingtao.

33:32.220 --> 33:33.200
Are you sure…

33:34.480 --> 33:35.980
you don't want me taking you to airport?

33:36.480 --> 33:38.480
I don't want you to see me off.

33:39.800 --> 33:42.200
Because I don't want you
to get back from the airport alone.

33:42.740 --> 33:44.380
I want you to pick me up at the airport.

33:44.880 --> 33:47.700
That way, when you see the airport,

33:49.300 --> 33:51.380
it occurs to you
that you're here to pick me up,

33:52.520 --> 33:54.840
instead of seeing me off.

34:04.560 --> 34:05.480
Come on.

34:07.080 --> 34:08.739
You're making me want to cry too.

34:08.780 --> 34:11.860
Let's just find somewhere
to cry our hearts out.

34:19.820 --> 34:20.980
Jiang Qiaoxi.

34:21.480 --> 34:24.260
You promised you'd come back for me.

34:25.280 --> 34:27.400
You… You promised.

34:27.440 --> 34:29.659
I'll wait for you, really.

34:29.699 --> 34:31.580
You gave me your word.

34:32.080 --> 34:33.139
That's a deal.

34:33.719 --> 34:34.699
Deal.

34:36.920 --> 34:38.280
I swore I'd find you.

34:38.320 --> 34:39.580
You promise.

34:42.980 --> 34:43.940
I promise.

35:12.240 --> 35:13.080
Jiang Qiaoxi.

35:14.240 --> 35:16.760
I like you very much. You know it.

35:28.800 --> 35:29.720
I know.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.380
I like you too.

35:35.220 --> 35:36.500
Beyond that,

35:37.060 --> 35:38.400
my dream

35:38.900 --> 35:40.520
is to become an exceptional teacher.

35:40.560 --> 35:42.620
Whether it's kindergarten,

35:42.660 --> 35:44.920
elementary, or high school.

35:45.880 --> 35:47.180
I want to use my strengths

35:47.220 --> 35:49.560
to help my students gain knowledge,

35:49.600 --> 35:51.260
understand themselves,

35:51.800 --> 35:52.960
accept who they are,

35:53.700 --> 35:54.780
and find their path

35:55.820 --> 35:57.260
forward in the future.

36:04.660 --> 36:05.500
What about you?

36:06.000 --> 36:07.380
What do you want to do?

36:12.360 --> 36:13.600
The old me

36:14.100 --> 36:15.340
wanted to give up math,

36:15.380 --> 36:18.260
to escape my parents.

36:18.300 --> 36:19.840
But now,

36:21.140 --> 36:23.760
especially after
what happened at my cousin's,

36:23.800 --> 36:25.120
I want to work in finance.

36:25.940 --> 36:27.880
I know this world

36:27.920 --> 36:29.440
can lift people up

36:30.460 --> 36:32.160
or crush them in a heartbeat.

36:34.260 --> 36:36.200
But with you by my side,

36:37.740 --> 36:38.780
I'm not afraid.

36:42.020 --> 36:43.020
I will be

36:43.560 --> 36:46.580
the one who lifts others up.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.320
Then go for it.

36:48.820 --> 36:50.460
Do what you love.

36:51.040 --> 36:52.920
I want you to become yourself.

36:55.740 --> 36:57.320
And I as myself too.

36:58.940 --> 37:00.420
Even if you and I,

37:01.500 --> 37:03.220
we are set out on different paths,

37:03.260 --> 37:04.860
we might not be able to stay together.

37:06.320 --> 37:08.740
But as long as we know
the love between us,

37:08.780 --> 37:10.720
the distance is nothing.

37:11.220 --> 37:12.900
Nothing will change, right?

37:15.740 --> 37:17.900
It's not like I can lose you more
after waiting

37:18.420 --> 37:19.840
for two years without a message.

37:20.820 --> 37:21.900
Things…

37:23.260 --> 37:25.760
can't get worse from here.

37:26.260 --> 37:28.500
Our future has to get brighter.

37:30.220 --> 37:32.100
So, do what you love.

37:34.520 --> 37:35.720
Stay in Hong Kong.

37:39.500 --> 37:40.880
That's how it is.

37:40.920 --> 37:42.560
Jiang Qiaoxi said

37:42.600 --> 37:44.620
he's coming for me.

37:45.120 --> 37:46.000
That's wonderful.

37:46.560 --> 37:47.520
So…

37:47.560 --> 37:48.640
did the story end

37:48.680 --> 37:51.020
with the prince and princess
living happily ever after?

37:55.640 --> 37:58.460
The princess is still in Hong Kong.

37:58.500 --> 38:02.040
But the prince who came to the rescue
has to return to Hongyang for studies.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.560
What happens next?

38:05.400 --> 38:06.400
Nobody knows.

38:06.900 --> 38:08.140
It's okay.

38:08.180 --> 38:09.420
Didn't the princess promise

38:09.460 --> 38:10.720
he'd always come to you?

38:10.760 --> 38:11.920
Besides,

38:12.420 --> 38:16.560
any princess who shares
his birthday wishes can't be a bad one.

38:17.340 --> 38:18.800
Good princesses always

38:19.300 --> 38:20.340
get good endings.

38:24.800 --> 38:25.900
Yu Qiao,

38:25.940 --> 38:27.480
I'm back from Hong Kong.

38:27.520 --> 38:29.520
Got you those Ray-Bans we talked about.

38:30.020 --> 38:31.880
I meant to buy them myself,

38:32.380 --> 38:34.980
but Jiang Qiaoxi insisted on paying.

38:35.600 --> 38:37.680
He said it's his thanks to you.

38:39.520 --> 38:42.200
Yu Qiao, thank you too.

38:52.300 --> 38:53.580
Are you still busy?

38:54.080 --> 38:56.000
Want me to drop them off?

39:02.700 --> 39:03.980
Yingtao, thanks.

39:04.480 --> 39:06.500
Still prepping
for the aviation academy exams.

39:06.540 --> 39:08.940
Got my Canada interview coming up.

39:08.980 --> 39:10.380
No time to spare.

39:10.420 --> 39:13.380
Tell Jiang Qiaoxi
one pair of Ray-Bans isn't enough.

39:13.420 --> 39:14.980
When he's back in Hongyang,

39:15.020 --> 39:16.380
I need him here with the sunglasses,

39:16.420 --> 39:17.900
bow to me with thanks in person.

39:23.220 --> 39:25.660
Okay, I'll tell him.

39:30.900 --> 39:31.900
QIN FAMILY MART

39:31.940 --> 39:33.340
- Thanks.
- Thank you.

39:41.660 --> 39:44.100
You two have been busy all day.
Take a break.

39:44.940 --> 39:47.340
Just show me what needs doing. I'll help.

39:47.380 --> 39:48.800
No need, Aunt Shuangyan.

39:48.840 --> 39:51.300
I won't feel comfortable
delivering these clothes

39:51.340 --> 39:52.740
until I've checked every stitch myself.

39:52.780 --> 39:53.980
Besides,

39:54.020 --> 39:56.180
my dad finally found
something he loves doing.

39:56.220 --> 39:58.200
Try stopping him now
and he'd just get grumpy.

39:58.740 --> 39:59.580
Shuangyan.

40:00.240 --> 40:01.440
This little gadget

40:01.480 --> 40:04.920
allows me to chat
with customers from all over.

40:05.420 --> 40:06.460
Kinda fascinating.

40:10.940 --> 40:12.320
YINGTAO

40:12.360 --> 40:13.680
Yingtao?

40:13.720 --> 40:14.600
Yun.

40:15.100 --> 40:17.300
Yingtao sent you a message on QQ.

40:20.960 --> 40:23.500
Yingtao found Qiaoxi?

40:24.000 --> 40:24.940
Yes.

40:24.980 --> 40:27.120
Jiang Qiaoxi fled all the way
to Hong Kong to avoid her,

40:27.160 --> 40:28.780
and still, she tracked him down.

40:30.840 --> 40:33.580
Yingtao and Qiaoxi,

40:34.080 --> 40:35.460
they are…

40:35.500 --> 40:37.760
Aunt Shuangyan,
it's exactly what you're thinking.

40:37.800 --> 40:39.100
Those two just look well-behaved.

40:44.000 --> 40:45.140
What about you?

40:46.500 --> 40:48.420
Dad, I am not into this.

40:51.620 --> 40:53.220
Yu Qiao…

40:53.720 --> 40:55.020
Dad, what are you talking about?

40:55.520 --> 40:57.900
Right now, the only thing
that matters to me is to buy a car.

40:59.400 --> 41:00.420
What?

41:01.140 --> 41:02.340
Buy a car?

41:02.380 --> 41:03.500
Yes, buy a car.

41:05.120 --> 41:07.140
Why even think about that?

41:07.180 --> 41:08.240
Cars are crazy expensive now,

41:08.840 --> 41:10.740
and you don't even have a license.

41:11.240 --> 41:12.620
I will get my license.

41:12.660 --> 41:14.320
I'll try my best to buy one.

41:14.360 --> 41:16.780
What I want is a car that is my favorite.

41:16.820 --> 41:18.440
The moment I drive it out,

41:18.480 --> 41:20.820
everyone will know I am somebody.

41:22.420 --> 41:24.460
I want to have the steering wheel
in my own hands.

41:25.020 --> 41:26.140
Listen to my favorite songs,

41:26.180 --> 41:27.120
drive a long way,

41:27.160 --> 41:28.940
and see many beautiful scenery.

41:29.520 --> 41:31.380
My passenger seat is reserved for you,

41:31.420 --> 41:32.680
for Yingtao,

41:32.720 --> 41:34.100
for Cai Fangyuan, Du Shang.

41:35.060 --> 41:36.620
Even Yu Qiao if he wants.

41:36.660 --> 41:38.740
And Aunt Shuangyan's got a spot too.

41:39.240 --> 41:41.520
I just wanna haul everyone I love

41:41.560 --> 41:43.700
to every corner of this beautiful world.

41:47.460 --> 41:49.420
Jiang Qiaoxi, I'm here.

41:49.460 --> 41:51.260
- Have you waited for me?
- Just a while.

41:51.300 --> 41:54.240
I got stopped in the hallway
by some juniors asking questions.

41:54.280 --> 41:57.340
Did you miss me today?

41:57.380 --> 41:58.700
Of course.

41:58.740 --> 42:00.400
I miss you too.

42:01.480 --> 42:02.660
Jiang Qiaoxi.

42:02.700 --> 42:03.660
What's wrong, Yingtao?

42:03.700 --> 42:06.180
I miss you very, very, very much.

42:06.220 --> 42:07.300
When I come back,

42:07.800 --> 42:09.760
I'll take you to the amusement park.

42:11.080 --> 42:12.100
Jiang Qiaoxi.

42:12.800 --> 42:15.080
Just showered. So many people there.

42:16.480 --> 42:18.640
- Hey!
- Oi, Yin?

42:19.440 --> 42:21.260
- Why are you in?
- Go away.

42:22.820 --> 42:24.020
Who let you in?

42:24.800 --> 42:25.780
What are you doing?

42:26.680 --> 42:27.940
Wow.

42:27.980 --> 42:28.820
Don't…

42:28.860 --> 42:30.040
- Who is that?
- What are you doing?

42:30.080 --> 42:31.080
Hello.

42:31.120 --> 42:32.220
- Hello.
- Hi.

42:32.260 --> 42:35.540
So, where are you two at now?

42:35.580 --> 42:38.640
Jiang Qiaoxi,
let's enjoy this beautiful dance.

42:50.400 --> 42:54.220
VIDEO CALLING

45:39.240 --> 45:42.500
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
